# Only mcp_server/, src/media_gen/, requirements.txt, and
# projects/registry.json are ever copied into an image (see Dockerfile and
# Dockerfile.steel-browser, which copies a subset of this) — this list is a
# second, explicit line of defense so a secret or an unrelated large
# directory can never end up in a build context accident.
.git
.venv
.venv-clean
.env
.env.*
*.credentials
credentials.json
*service-account*.json
*sa-key*.json
gcp-*.json
gha-creds-*.json
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
logs/
public/
web/
guides/
competitions/
docs/
data/
tests/
scripts/
.github/
.gpt-ops/
*.md
